    "detailed_description": "Bits at Work is a small office management game set in the world of Bit ESC.<br>Create, manage and expand your office, make sure your bits are happy, and keep the line going up and up and up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/2050b6d5c71d137da9964cb2e2405a07.poster.avif?t=1728316581\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/2050b6d5c71d137da9964cb2e2405a07.webm?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/2050b6d5c71d137da9964cb2e2405a07.mp4?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CREATE YOUR DREAM WORKPLACE</strong><br>Layout your office however you like. Build, expand and keep adding new facilities for your employees.<br><br><strong>MANAGE YOUR BITS</strong><br>Employees are the lifeblood of a company. Manage your team and make sure they're happy<br><br><strong>RAKE IN THE PROFITS</strong><br>The line must keep going up and up and up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/25c8737a4dfdbad2c681642a8c92eaeb.poster.avif?t=1728316581\" width=498 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/25c8737a4dfdbad2c681642a8c92eaeb.webm?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/25c8737a4dfdbad2c681642a8c92eaeb.mp4?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Bits at Work is a small office management game set in the world of Bit ESC.<br>Create, manage and expand your office, make sure your bits are happy, and keep the line going up and up and up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/2050b6d5c71d137da9964cb2e2405a07.poster.avif?t=1728316581\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/2050b6d5c71d137da9964cb2e2405a07.webm?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/2050b6d5c71d137da9964cb2e2405a07.mp4?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>CREATE YOUR DREAM WORKPLACE</strong><br>Layout your office however you like. Build, expand and keep adding new facilities for your employees.<br><br><strong>MANAGE YOUR BITS</strong><br>Employees are the lifeblood of a company. Manage your team and make sure they're happy<br><br><strong>RAKE IN THE PROFITS</strong><br>The line must keep going up and up and up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/25c8737a4dfdbad2c681642a8c92eaeb.poster.avif?t=1728316581\" width=498 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/25c8737a4dfdbad2c681642a8c92eaeb.webm?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159130/extras/25c8737a4dfdbad2c681642a8c92eaeb.mp4?t=1728316581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
